 "remarks": "Luxury condo living at its finest - spacious, pristine and stylish, this recently-renovated 2 BR/2.5 BTH unit located right in the heart of Westport offers a dramatic, modern aesthetic, and tranquil feel. Enjoy soaring ceilings, walls of glass and gorgeous wide plank floors. The sleek new kitchen and spacious great room with fireplace adjoin a beautiful private courtyard. A second sitting (or large dining) room adjoins an additional secluded patio. The sunny, quiet primary suite with spa bath is located on the main level, as is the laundry/mudroom and huge 2-car attached garage. Upstairs there is an attractive guest bedroom, bath and spacious study/loft space, plus a giant walk in storage closet. The finished lower level has rec and exercise rooms, and huge unfinished storage or hobby space. Gorgeous swimming pool area with clubhouse and tennis courts to relax and entertain in an exclusive setting. Fabulous, convenient location just a short walk to a variety of gourmet dining and shopping options, and a quick hop to beaches and Metro North station. Rental includes all grounds maintenance, trash, internet and cable.",
